---
// Testimonials — 4 client stories. #testimonials anchor preserved.
---

<section id="testimonials" class="testimonials section" aria-label="Client testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-scroll-reveal>
      <span class="section-tag">Client Stories</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-cs-title>Results that <span class="gradient-text">speak for themselves</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="0">
        <div class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>"ClarityScale rebuilt our entire online presence in under 3 weeks. Our website traffic tripled and we started getting inbound leads for the first time ever. Genuinely life-changing for our business."</blockquote>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00d4ff,#6a1de0)">JM</div>
          <div class="author-info"><strong>Jordan Mitchell</strong><span>Founder · NovaBrew Co.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card testimonial-card-accent" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="100">
        <div class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>"We needed a brand that matched our premium positioning. ClarityScale delivered beyond what we imagined — the new identity, website, and strategy completely transformed how clients perceive us."</blockquote>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d41fb0,#ff6a00)">SR</div>
          <div class="author-info"><strong>Sophia Reyes</strong><span>CEO · Luxe Realty Group</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="200">
        <div class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>"From day one, the ClarityScale team felt like an extension of ours. They're strategic, creative, fast, and genuinely care about results. Our e-commerce revenue jumped 280% in the first 90 days."</blockquote>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2979ff,#d41fb0)">KA</div>
          <div class="author-info"><strong>Kai Anderson</strong><span>Director · PeakFit Store</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="300">
        <div class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>"Other agencies talk about growth — ClarityScale actually delivers it. Clear communication, no fluff, and a team that treats your business like their own. Highly recommend to any serious business owner."</blockquote>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6a1de0,#00d4ff)">TN</div>
          <div class="author-info"><strong>Tara Nguyen</strong><span>CMO · Zenit SaaS</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
